        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/{size}/1914_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-06-20T16:15:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think the Writers' Room format will be interesting. My favorite part of this podcast is hearing Christopher and Adam tell stories - I think that's why I liked the OblivAeon episodes best, why I like the questions that unexpectedly provoke 20-minute stories, and why the Patreon votes have been focusing on such granular topics, as Christopher put it. Anything that lets C&amp;A punch up the storytelling while giving them a mechanism to build up content for future games sounds good to me!</p>",
