        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "Speaking of Gen Con, if anyone is going to be there and doesn't have a question they want to ask (and therefore would be willing to ask one on my behalf) I would very much appreciate it.\r\n\r\nIt's one I've been wondering for a while, and I HAVE sent it in, but it's unimportant enough that they probably won't address it unless it's asked live. (In fact, they just had an episode involving the character it's about, so I'm pretty sure they decided to ignore it.) And thanks to my unpredictable work schedule and tight financial situation, I can't make it myself.\r\n\r\nIf not that's fine, but if someone is willing to do that for me I would appreciate it a lot!",
